flowchart LR
    CONN[connected] --> DROP{onConnectionStateChange DISCONNECTED / status 133}
    DROP --> CLOSE[gatt.close - avoid leak]
    CLOSE --> RETRY{attempts left?}
    RETRY -->|yes| BACKOFF[exponential backoff + jitter - Ch 2]
    BACKOFF --> RECONNECT[reconnect]
    RETRY -->|no| FAIL[ConnectionState.Failed -> surface to UI]
